        "box_4Kyjpx": {
          "type": "box",
          "settings": {
            "box_content": "<p><strong>We take the current best practices</strong> in content and make affordable packages that not only deliver on performance, but deliver at scale. Our content packages can be anything you need but are mostly designed for Pointing out benefits, Hitting on problems the product solves, or resolving concerns the customer might have about your product/service. Every creative serves a specific purpose. That’s our secret sauce for success. This isn’t a game of “this is working best, so let’s make more of this.” We want to have confidence in understanding WHY a creative performed or not.</p>",
